        "original_id": "75e26d86-4a64-5f26-98c5-466df062c7ff",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Hancock and Joan, Shameless, Silk, The Village\n- People: Tony Hancock, Joan Le Mesurier, John Le Mesurier, Maxine Peake\n- Organizations: Channel 4, BBC\n- Roles: Veronica Ball, Martha Costello, Grace Middleton\n\nFacts:\n- Hancock and Joan is a 2008 British biographical television film about the affair between comedian Tony Hancock and Joan Le Mesurier.\n- Joan Le Mesurier was the third wife of actor John Le Mesurier.\n- Maxine Peake played Veronica Ball in Channel 4's Manchester-based comedy-drama series Shameless.\n- Maxine Peake played barrister Martha Costello in the BBC legal drama Silk.\n- Maxine Peake played Grace Middleton in The Village.",
